              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left|\\cos x+\\cos 3x\\right|=-\\cos 2x\"></span>.</li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\pi;\\frac{\\pi}{2}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:55:46.351728+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{\\pi k}{2},-\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k,\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T18:55:46.351728+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"9467529c-9853-480f-883c-7f4b1ca3ed59\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/> </p><p>а)  Ис­ход­ное урав­не­ние имеет смысл толь­ко при  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 2x\\le 0\"></span>, тогда это эк­ви­ва­лент­но со­во­куп­но­сти:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos x+\\cos 3x=-\\cos 2x\\\\\\cos x+\\cos 3x=\\cos 2x\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}2\\cos 2x\\cdot \\cos x+\\cos 2x=0\\\\2\\cos 2x\\cdot \\cos x-\\cos 2x=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos 2x(2\\cos x+1)=0\\\\\\cos 2x(2\\cos x-1)=0\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\cos 2x=0\\\\\\cos x=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\cos x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}+\\frac{\\pi k}{2}\\\\x=-\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}+\\pi k\\\\k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\end{aligned}\\right.\"></span> . </p><p></p></center><p>Все най­ден­ные серии кор­ней удо­вле­тво­ря­ют усло­вию  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos 2x\\le 0\"></span>. </p><p>б)  От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.), по­лу­чим:  <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{3\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{2\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span> ,   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{4}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{3}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
