                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{16^{\\sin x}-3\\cdot 4^{\\frac{1}{2}+\\sin x}+8}{\\log_2 (1-3\\cos x)}=0\"></span>. </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Ука­жи­те корни этого урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{3\\pi}{4};\\frac{6\\pi}{5}]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:37:11.411360+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T19:37:11.411360+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"715a277b-adf0-4b65-b091-b9a22c8fcf66\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\"/></p><p>а)  При усло­вии  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\lt \\frac{1}{3}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\cos x\\ne 0\"></span> ис­ход­ное урав­не­ние сво­дит­ся к квад­рат­но­му от­но­си­тель­но по­ка­за­тель­ной функ­ции:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"16^{\\sin x}-3\\cdot 4^{\\frac{1}{2}+\\sin x}+8=0\\iff (4^{\\sin x})^{2}-6\\cdot 4^{\\sin x}+8=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}4^{\\sin x}=2\\\\4^{\\sin x}=4\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\sin x=1\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p></p></center><p>Усло­вию рав­но­силь­но­сти удо­вле­тво­ря­ет толь­ко серия <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p><p>б)  Отберём корни при по­мо­щи еди­нич­ной окруж­но­сти (см. рис.). Под­хо­дит толь­ко  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": [
                  "image_1"
                ]
              },
